==Trivia==
*Armored Firefly Cat's design heavily resembles [[wikia:viewtifuljoe:Viewtiful Joe|Viewtiful Joe]]'s, especially the white gloves and helmet.
*As seen in various Banners, Armored Firefly Cat likely serves as the [[:wikipedia:Gyōji|Gyōji]], or referee, in [[Summer Break Cats#Bug Sumo Preliminaries|Bug Sumo]] matches, as it holds a [[:wikipedia:Gunbai|gunbai]].
*Ancient Egg: N202, [[Ancient Egg: N204 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N204]] and [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N004]] are currently the only [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]] whose Evolved and True Forms affect more than one trait with their abilities.

